OL,3,ANvidia hires major New York law firm to
OL,4,Ainvestigate Jensen Huang affair
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe woman, Alice Huang, is alleged to
OL,7,Fbe a spy for Beijing. She was an
OL,8,Fexecutive at a Singaporean company
OL,9,FMegaspeed, which has been a customer of
OL,10,FNvidia.
OL,12,FNvidia said on Tuesday that Wachtell
OL,13,Fattorney Joon Kim was set to lead "a
OL,14,Fthorough and independent investigation"
OL,15,Finto Jensen Huang's affair. The FBI is
OL,16,Falso conducting its own probe.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
